              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Maraika ondiijo yaaruga omuri hekalu, yaagamba n'eiraka rihango, naagira Ogwo owaabaire ashutami aha kicu ati: Kiika omuhoro gwawe oteme, ahabw'okuba obunaku bw'okutema buhikire; kandi eby'okushaaruurwa by'ensi byereire kimwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
